#AREA Tanglewood forest~
#AUTHORS Tanis  ~





#HELPS
-1 TANGLEWOOD~
Tanglewood forest, levels 5 - 10

Tanglewood forest is a newbie area located 1 east and 1 north from the east
gate of chakkor. It features marauding bands of orcs, monsters under beds
and all sorts of other frightening newbie stuff.~
0 $~




